{
    "0": {
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I admit it. I underestimated their plan."
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They even attracted one of the Sages. Fantastic!"
            ]
        },
        "230_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So there you are."
            ]
        },
        "238_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You are not who I'm looking for,",
                "but you can guide me to her."
            ]
        },
        "246_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am here to talk with that Magician Hijiri."
            ]
        },
        "254_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose she can explain me something.~"
            ]
        },
        "262_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What a pleasure of having the Hidden Goddess",
                "in our sacred shrine!"
            ]
        },
        "270_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Our master is delighted with your visit."
            ]
        },
        "278_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She also wants to see you."
            ]
        },
        "286_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then why so slow?",
                "I want to see her instantly."
            ]
        },
        "294_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's nothing to worry about.",
                "My lady."
            ]
        },
        "302_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's we were expecting."
            ]
        },
        "310_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will guide you to her."
            ]
        },
        "318_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But first..."
            ]
        },
        "326_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will offer you the hospitality of",
                "the Myouren Temple!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Magnificent! I will guide you to her."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everything is prepared."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soon, we're able to make a better Gensokyo!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You brag so loud."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't need to ask your intentions.",
                "I caught you."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh? What do you mean?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I mean: Your plan to alter Gensokyo is <b$over>."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now. Byakuren, show up already!"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uhg, I should have expected this."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Th-... Then the plan isn't working well!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is terrible..."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We need to idealize another plan."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I should tell this to everyone!"
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm..."
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So it was true after all..."
            ]
